<title>USA: Mercantile Stores Co Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Stores Co Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFIELD, Ohio 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.85		    $0.79</p>
<p> Net			 31,088		   29,210</p>
<p> Revs		     727,741		  694,765</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  36,844		   36,844</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.60		    $1.24</p>
<p> Net			 58,793		   45,664</p>
<p> Revs		   2,042,677		1,940,071</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  36,844		   36,844</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call earnings consensus estimate for 1996 Q3 was $0.85 per share.</p>
<p>The 1996 thirty-nine weeks reflects a pre-tax charge totaling $12 million, or $0.20 per share, attributable to the adoption of a new accounting standard related to the impairment of long-lived assets.</p>
<p>Full company name is Mercantile Stores Co Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
